Fusion Dedicated
================

An independent reimplementation of the BONELAB Fusion network protocol, so that a
dedicated server can interoperate with unmodified Fusion clients.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Lakatrazz, the
Fusion contributors, or Stress Level Zero. All game content, and the design of the
protocol itself, belong to their respective authors.


